# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Built CLI binary (go build ./cmd/misterspec)
/misterspec

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Disposable misterspec context-engine cache (014-sqlite-index) — never
# authoritative, fully rebuildable, including inside any fixture project
# (e.g. specs/019-dogfooding-evaluation/fixture/.misterspec/cache/).
**/.misterspec/cache/

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/
